; Minimal congruence demo. Two nullary constructors A and B get unioned;
; by congruence, F(A) and F(B) must also be in the same e-class.
;
; This is the simplest case where RAW-match alone is insufficient: the
; structural match for the rewrite never fires (there IS no rewrite),
; yet F(A) ≡ F(B) must hold. Only a congruence rule derives that.
;
; Cross-check: `egglog congruence.egg` must exit 0.
; Ported to ascent_tests_dd/src/egglog_port.rs::congruence_naive_fails /
;                                            ::congruence_with_rule_works.

(datatype Math
   (A)
   (B)
   (F Math))

(F (A))
(F (B))

(union (A) (B))

(run 1)

(check (= (F (A)) (F (B))))
